- NetMiniMap MINIMAP_SIZE? check constant and MAP_SIZE. Also note `_world_to_minimap` no flip; net minimap probably uses player team fixed (TEAM_PLAYER) no flip.

Check NetMiniMap constants (MAP_SIZE, MINIMAP_SIZE).

